# Drop the bubble artwork here as PNGs with transparent backgrounds:
#
#   cars.png  speech.png  door.png  alarm.png  birds.png  unknown.png
#
# 256x256 or larger. Until a file exists the app falls back to its Material
# glyph, so a missing image degrades to a recognisable symbol rather than a
# blank gap. Declared in pubspec.yaml as `assets/icons/`.
